# Keyed hashes (HMAC-SHA256, RFC 2104) of lowercase words that must not appear
# in tracked files (#192, SEC-5). Hashes only, never the words; the words are
# unrecoverable from this file without the key, which is never committed
# (local: ~/.config/birdcage/no-real-names.key; CI: NO_REAL_NAMES_KEY_FILE).
# Add an entry: scripts/no-real-names.py --add, type the word (not echoed),
# append the printed line below. Never put the word on the command line.
# The first non-comment line is the format header; an empty list is refused.
hmac-sha256
